:: R4_SQ_PhoneCheck [r4 sidequest]
<<set $flags.r4PhoneCheck = true>>
<<moodimage "files/images/mood/r4-sq-phone-glow.png" "">>
<<objective "Sit with the thought a while.">>

8:47 PM. I'm on the couch. Lena is in the bedroom reading. My phone buzzes. Work email. Nothing important. I swipe it away.

But the motion of swiping makes me think about phones. About Lena's phone. About the text she got at the holiday party from Adrian Wolfe. //It was wonderful meeting you tonight. Daniel's a lucky man.// A sentence designed to be harmless. A sentence that is harmless if you read it in one light and something else entirely if you read it in another.

I don't check her phone. Not tonight. Not yet. The panties are enough new information for one day. My body is still processing the data of twelve hours in silk. My brain doesn't have the bandwidth for the data of my wife's text messages.

